### 1. 상품 등록 (1번 상품 준비)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "아이스 아메리카노",
  "price": 4500,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/coffee.jpg"
}

### 2. 회원 A 가입 (토큰 저장)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "a@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

> {% client.global.set("tokenA", response.body.token); %}

### 3. 회원 B 가입 (토큰 저장)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "b@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

> {% client.global.set("tokenB", response.body.token); %}

### 4. 토큰 없이 위시 담기 (401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1
}

### 5. 가짜 토큰으로 위시 담기 (401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wishes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer fake.token.value

{
  "productId": 1
}

### 6. A가 1번 상품 담기 (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wishes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

{
  "productId": 1
}

### 7. A가 같은 상품 또 담기 (409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wishes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

{
  "productId": 1
}

### 8. A가 없는 상품 담기 (404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wishes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

{
  "productId": 99
}

### 9. A의 위시 목록 (200, 1개)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wishes
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### 10. B의 위시 목록 (200, 빈 목록)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wishes
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

### 11. B가 A의 위시 삭제 (403)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/wishes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

### 12. A가 없는 위시 삭제 (404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/wishes/99
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### 13. A가 자기 위시 삭제 (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/wishes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### 14. 삭제 뒤 A의 위시 목록 (200, 빈 목록)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wishes
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}